        "edit": "Fix the two malformed one-hot literals in the case statement: 3'b100 now assigns 8'b0001_0000 (was 8'b0001_000, missing a zero) and 3'b111 now assigns 8'b1000_0000 (was 8'b100_0000, missing a zero).",
